    {
      "id": "card-CHAIN_15_DIGITAL_GOVERNANCE_DATA",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 3520,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 240,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \u26a1 Chain #15: Digital Public Infrastructure, Open Networks & Data Protection Rules\n**Pillar:** `GS3 Science & GS2 Governance`\n\n> **Core Driver:** Notification of Digital Personal Data Protection (DPDP) Act subordinate rules.\n\n*Total Linked Dispatches:* 2",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-CHAIN_15_DIGITAL_GOVERNANCE_DATA-0",
      "x": 1350,
      "y": 3520,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 220,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Step 1: MeitY**\n\nFormulated Data Protection Board operating procedures and open network DigiDukaan rails.",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-CHAIN_15_DIGITAL_GOVERNANCE_DATA-1",
      "x": 1730,
      "y": 3520,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 220,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Step 2: Ministry of Law & Justice**\n\nVetted statutory compliance for cross-border data transfer safeguards.",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "pillar-legal-tiers",
      "x": -800,
      "y": -900,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 600,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## \u2696\ufe0f THE 5 INSTITUTIONAL LEGAL TIERS\n### Deterministic Entity Disambiguation (TASK_080)\n\n### Tier 1: Constitutional Bodies (Art. 75, 324, 338)\n- ECI \u00b7 NCSC \u00b7 Union Council of Ministers\n- *Neutralizes PSY_03 Legal Tier Shifts*\n\n### Tier 2: Statutory Regulators (Acts of Parliament)\n- RBI \u00b7 SEBI \u00b7 NFRA \u00b7 CARA \u00b7 NBA \u00b7 BIS \u00b7 CPCB\n- *Neutralizes PSY_01 Authority Swaps*\n\n### Tier 3: Executive Business Divisions\n- India Semiconductor Mission (ISM / MeitY)\n- PM GatiShakti NPG \u00b7 GeM \u00b7 DigiDukaan\n\n### Tier 4: Apex Industry Societies\n- Society of Indian Defence Manufacturers (SIDM)\n\n### Tier 5: Commercial PSUs\n- Uranium Corp (UCIL) \u00b7 Coal India (CIL)",
      "color": "1"
    }
